1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,860
Accept what happened. The past is done. You can't go back and change it no matter how much you want to.

2
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:18,400
What you can do is stop letting it control your present. Accept it and learn from it.

3
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:24,920
Don't let the past be your whole story. Let it be just one chapter.
